  "gaps": [
    "No semantic typechecker or cross-file/import/re-export resolution.",
    "No inherited-member cloning, generic substitution, override/conflict evaluation or recursive inherited API expansion.",
    "Overloads are repeated source declarations, not distinct documented feature or runtime acceptance counts.",
    "Event projections identify direct Event<T>/vscode.Event<T> annotations only; event-shaped aliases are not inferred.",
    "JSDoc spans and direct links are retained; prose is not atomically interpreted and inherited documentation is not synthesized.",
    "Mapped/conditional/union/indexed types are retained as syntax spans, not enumerated into concrete members.",
    "One extension API declaration is not the full workbench manual, command/settings/keybinding/UI inventory, proposed API files, built-in extension APIs or implemented product parity."
